11
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:28,070
When I teach them about
everything in Wikipedia,

12
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:32,272
I stress the fact that you
cannot copy the entire contents

13
00:00:32,272 --> 00:00:33,710
