42
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:09,090
So far, my students
wrote about 170 articles.

43
00:02:09,090 --> 00:02:14,360
Those articles got around
a million views so far.

44
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:18,430
I took that course and
I adjusted it a bit

45
00:02:18,430 --> 00:02:23,070
